<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 20px;">
  <h2>You've been invited to the WebLaud Portal</h2>

  <p>Hi {{firstName}},</p>

  <p>
    {{#if inviterOrg}}
      {{inviterOrg}} has
    {{else}}
      WebLaud has
    {{/if}}
    invited you to the client portal, where you can track project progress, updates, files, and invoices.
  </p>

  <p style="margin: 28px 0;">
    <a
      href="{{acceptUrl}}"
      style="background: #0a84ff; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;"
    >
      Accept invitation
    </a>
  </p>

  <p>This link is valid for {{ttlHours}} hours. If it expires, ask your project manager to resend it.</p>

  <p>If you weren't expecting this, you can safely ignore this email.</p>

  <br/>
  <strong>WebLaud Team</strong>
</div>
